    Shape:
        - Input: :math:`( *)` where `*` means, any number of additional
          dimensions.
        - Output: :math:`(*)`, same shape as the input.

    Attributes:
        weight (Tensor): the learnable weights of shape (:attr:`num_parameters`).

    .. image:: ../scripts/activation_images/PReLU.png

    Examples::

